### Tüm görevleri getir
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks


### Görev getir
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/5


### Yeni görev oluştur
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{

    "title": "Tarihli Görev2",
    "desc": "createDate test",
    "priority": "Orta",
    "assignee": "Mert Ünal",
    "completed": false
}


### PUT Task güncelle 
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Görev Gücellendi",
    "desc": "Bu task TEKRAR güncellendi.",
     "priority": "Orta",
    "assignee": "Mert Ünal",
    "completed": true
}


### Delete Task
DELETE  http://localhost:3000/tasks/7



### Delete All Tasks
DELETE  http://localhost:3000/tasks


### Kelimeye göre arama
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/search?keyword=expr


### Kullanıcının görevleri getir
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/assignee/Mert Ünal

### Status- bitmiş görevler
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?completed=true

#### Status- bitmemiş görevler
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?completed=false



### En yeniye göre sırala
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?sort=createDate&order=desc

### En eskiye göre sırala
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks?sort=createDate&order=asc